    "xtu_rich_content_xWzDGq": {
      "type": "xtu-rich-content",
      "blocks": {
        "richtext_3y47m6": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>More Storage for Everyday Dash Cam Recording</strong></p><p>Designed for dash cam recording, the <strong>GKU 128GB MicroSD Card</strong> provides more storage for daily commuting, longer drives and continuous loop recording.</p><p>With <strong>U3, V30 and Class 10 speed ratings</strong>, support for <strong>4K UHD recording</strong>, and transfer speeds of up to <strong>100MB/s</strong>, it delivers reliable storage and smooth performance for everyday dash cam use.</p><p>Perfect for drivers who need more recording space for daily footage, road trips and parking recordings.</p><ul><li>128GB Large Capacity</li><li>U3 / V30 / Class 10</li><li>Supports 4K UHD Recording</li><li>Up to 100MB/s Transfer Speed</li><li>High-Endurance Design</li><li>Supports Loop Recording</li><li>Card Reader Included</li></ul><p>Looking for a dash cam that supports high-resolution recording? Explore our <a href=\"https://www.gkutech.com/collections/4k-dash-cam?utm_source=chatgpt.com\"><strong>4K Dash Cams</strong></a>.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_8m7aCi": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/128-_1_477370a5-8033-421f-864f-1e6e521b9d0e.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU 128GB U3 V30 microSD card with dash cam for smooth 4K recording and fast file transfer",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 32,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "richtext_3y47m6",
        "image_8m7aCi"
      ],
      "name": "XTU Rich Content",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "GKU 128GB High Endurance MicroSD Card",
        "subheading": "",
        "heading_align": "center",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "content_background": "#ffffff",
        "heading_color": "#000000",
        "muted_text_color": "#8e9297",
        "placeholder_bg": "#e8eaed",
        "media_bg": "#111111",
        "link_color": "#0070ca",
