    "xtu_rich_content_jeQBqh": {
      "type": "xtu-rich-content",
      "blocks": {
        "richtext_3hgxCP": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>More Storage for Longer Recording</strong></p><p>The <strong>128GB capacity</strong> provides more room for everyday driving footage, allowing you to keep more recordings before loop recording begins overwriting older normal video files.</p><p>It is a practical choice for daily drivers, longer trips and users who prefer more recording history between file overwrites.</p><p><strong>Need Less Storage?</strong></p><p>For shorter daily commutes and lighter recording needs, choose the <a href=\"https://www.gkutech.com/products/gku-64gb-high-endurance-microsd-card-for-dash-cam?utm_source=chatgpt.com\"><strong>GKU 64GB High Endurance MicroSD Card</strong></a>.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_HXwckU": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/679555c5-d9e6-4f5c-b1f0-7ff72f06fec1.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU 128GB U3 V30 microSD card for stable Full HD and 4K dash cam recording",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_FdajfF": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Fast Transfer for Easier File Access, Up to 100MB/s Read & Write Speed</strong></p><p>With read and write speeds of up to <strong>100MB/s</strong>, the GKU 128GB MicroSD Card makes it faster and easier to access, review and manage your recorded footage.</p><p>The included card reader also provides a convenient way to connect the memory card to a compatible device.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_7k8pzG": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/128-_3_b2046d8b-6c63-4134-b8e1-36f75c8bac53.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU 128GB microSD card with included card reader and up to 100MB/s read and write speed",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_eXFeU4": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Smooth 4K Video Recording, U3, V30 & Class 10 Performance</strong></p><p>Built with <strong>U3, V30 and Class 10 speed ratings</strong>, the GKU 128GB MicroSD Card supports stable high-resolution video recording for compatible dash cams.</p><p>It is designed to handle continuous recording while maintaining smooth performance for <strong>4K UHD footage</strong>.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_LpHxMG": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Stable Support for Loop Recording</strong></p><p>Designed for continuous dash cam use, the memory card supports normal loop recording operation.</p><p>When storage becomes full, a compatible dash cam can automatically overwrite the oldest normal video files with new recordings, helping maintain continuous recording without frequent manual file deletion.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_tLz6dw": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Wide Device Compatibility, Built for Dash Cams and More</strong></p><p>Designed primarily for dash cam recording, the GKU 128GB MicroSD Card can also be used with other compatible devices that support microSD storage.</p><p>Always check your device's supported storage capacity and memory card requirements before use.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_3Fa7Fp": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/128-_2_3b12fd8b-a9ff-4691-9fe5-9afc8fb67479.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU 128GB microSD card compatible with dash cams, cameras, laptops and other supported devices",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 24,
